///{ sliceField: auto | dropdown | autocomplete | slider | radio | checkbox }
table Slices [slice] = slice by Project.PhaseId title: Project.PhaseId
Slices.PhaseId = single(Project.PhaseId)
// Slices.Phase = single(Project.Phase)
// Slices.PhaseCode = single(Project.PhaseCode)

show slicepicker "Project Timeline" a21g22 {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with
  // Slices. {sliceField: radio}
  Slices.PhaseId as "Project Phase" {sliceField: slider}
  // single(Catalog.IsActive) as "Active"  {sliceField: checkbox}
  // Slices.Name {sliceField: dropdown}

kickOff = date(2021,12,15)
today = today()
Project.PhaseStartDate = kickOff + ((Project.PhaseCode - 1) * 14)
Project.PhaseEndDate = Project.PhaseStartDate + 13


currentPhase = same(Project.Phase) when (Project.PhaseStartDate <= today and Project.PhaseEndDate >= today) default ""
Project.Expected = if Project.PhaseStartDate >= today then "(Expected)" else ""

show scalar "Project Kick Off" f1g1 d0021b {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones" ; textAlign: right} with kickOff
show scalar "Current Project Phase" f2g2 d0021b {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones" ; textAlign: right} with currentPhase

show scalar "Project Phase" a23c23 slices: Project.slice {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with same(Project.Phase)
// show table same("Phase Description") by Slice e5h6 slices: Project.Slice {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with Project.Description
show table "Project Phases" a24g28 {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with
  Project.Phase as "Phase"
  Project.Description as "Description" {columnWidth: 3}

show scalar same("Project Phase Start Date \{Project.Expected}") by slice f23g23 slices: Project.slice {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with same(Project.PhaseStartDate)
show scalar same("Project Phase End Date \{Project.Expected}") by slice d23e23 slices: Project.slice {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with same(Project.PhaseEndDate)

show label same(Project.PhaseImageURL) by slice a17g20 {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"}

show label (downloadUrl("9ADFA28360DAB7487984181FF06918D7", "TimelineTemplate.PNG")) a9g15 {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"}

show markdown "Project Timeline" a4g8 {tileTab: "Timeline and Milestones"} with """
  # General Timeline

  __Phase I: Data Pipeline and Cleaning__
  This phase involves the sharing of the Data Wishlist of fields and dataframes that will be required for phase 2 by Lokad, creation of an automated data pipeline
  for a daily data update, and the creation of the Data Health dashboards for checking data integrity, primary and secondary keys between tables, missing or illogical values,
  and that high level business KPIs are equivalent between Lokad and the Company.

  __Phase II: Forecasting and Optimization__
  The second phase begins with a deeper discussion of the economic and business factors that will be the primary drivers of the optimization, the scope of items to be included in the
  forecast, dispatch, and purchasing optimizations. This phase is an iterative process as the initial forecast and optimization
  is created and expected behaviors (seasonality, categories, etc.) are compared with the first results, and the scope is clarified and edge cases are handled.

  __Phase III: Prototyping, Testing, and Finetuneing__
  The final phase in the onboarding process, this is also primarily an iterative phase with the users using the recommended purchase and dispatch lists daily/weekly/etc. and
  looking for stark discrepancies compared to the expected values, and modifying or finetuneing the optimization. Additional reporting dashboards and tools are also used and modified
  as the user discovers which features they require or do not need.

  __Phase IV: Production__
  Weekly support for optimization and recommendation, as well as the creation of additional reporting dashboards if requested.

"""


